Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>m</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> The <strong>ceiling</strong> of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"x\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\left\\lceil x \\right\\rceil\n\\mathrel{:=} -\\left\\lfloor -x \\right\\rfloor\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2308\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2309\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"REL\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"2\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c230A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c230B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">⌈</mo><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⌉</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><mo>:=</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><